{"id":"npc:%E8%B5%AB%E6%9B%BC","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"萨卡兹，因奥卢斯异变为海嗣。在失去意识时与蕾缪安发生冲突而遭到追杀，被奥卢斯救下，回到自己屋中，被赶来调查的费德里科发现，但被杰拉尔德救下。之后恢复神智，并跟随奥卢斯回到大海。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情HE-3_岂可空手回天府？、HE-5_主在圣殿中等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_930_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_930_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_930_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_end","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":436,"line":437,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":459,"line":460,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"啊……孩子……"},{"commandIndex":460,"line":461,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"我的、孩子……"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_st03","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":275,"line":276,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"嗯……"},{"commandIndex":282,"line":283,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"那些拉特兰人，他们会善待那两个孩子吗……？"},{"commandIndex":293,"line":294,"speaker":"赫曼","text":"……"}]}]}